        { "text", text = "The |cOXP_ENEMY_Chimaera Matriarch|r (level 28, not elite, larger than the young ones around her) roams the south edge of the Charred Vale in south-west Stonetalon, near the road to Desolace. She is the only one: she returns 5 minutes after dying and drops the |cOXP_LOOT_Galvanized Horn|r four kills in five. She spits Corrosive Poison from 30 yards." },
