      { only = "Warrior", source = "polestar:forever/class/warrior/brutal-armor", when = { { "onquest", quests = { 1846 } } },
        { "text", text = "Dragonmaw Shinbones" },
        { "text", text = "The Dragonmaw orcs (level 26-30) camp in the middle of the Wetlands; from Hammerfall in Arathi head south over the Thandol Span (Menethil Harbor is Alliance). With Dragonmaw Shinbones from |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Velora Nitely|r in your log, every Raider, Swamprunner, Centurion, Shadowwarder and Bonewarder drops a |cOXP_LOOT_Dragonmaw Shinbone|r (without the quest they drop none): right-click it to test it, and about one in four comes out sturdy, the rest break, so expect 30 or more kills for 8. You can test while moving or fighting. The orcs run for help at 15%; Raiders net you, Centurions shield-bash, Shadowwarders cast Shadow Bolt, Bonewarders raise skeletons." },
        { "goto", x = 45.72, y = 44.78, zone = "1437" },
        { "item", count = 1, item = 7131, text = "Dragonmaw Shinbone: 1 (from the Dragonmaw orcs: right-click to test it)" },
