      { only = "Rogue", source = "polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-horn-of-xelthos",
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Veenix|r" },
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Veenix|r, a goblin friendly to both factions, stands among the Venture Co. in the Windshear Crag, east Stonetalon, a short way north-east of Sun Rock Retreat. Horde fly to Sun Rock Retreat; Alliance to Stonetalon Peak. He wants a |cOXP_LOOT_Venture Co. Work Order|r before he hands over explosives: the Venture Co. Loggers (level 18) working around him carry them in their pockets. Stealth up behind one and Pick Pocket it; killing them does not give it." },
