      { only = "Rogue", source = "polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-horn-of-xelthos",
        { "text", text = "Shadowfang Keep" },
        { "text", text = "Go in alone and use the |cOXP_LOOT_Breaching Charge|r at the courtyard gate. Players also report a freed prisoner opening the courtyard door for you: if you die while he is opening it, stay dead until it is open; it stays open once you release. If you know Vanish, bring |cOXP_LOOT_Flash Powder|r and check its cooldown before entering; keep it ready for a failed approach. Pickpocket the sister in the dining hall for the |cOXP_LOOT_Sister's Half-Key|r, then the brother in the room reached by turning right at the top of the stairs for the |cOXP_LOOT_Brother's Half-Key|r (a level 20 rogue without Vanish may need ranks in Master of Deception to reach the second one unseen). Combine them somewhere safe: this breaks stealth. Free a bag slot first: opening the chest with full bags can use up the key without giving the horn. Return to the courtyard stables and use the combined key on the chest for the horn. Stay clear of the nearby elites; the minimum quest level does not guarantee a safe approach." },
        { "goto", x = 44.8, y = 67.8, zone = "1421" },
        { "complete", obj = 1, quest = 78261, text = "Horn of Xelthos: 1 (|cOXP_LOOT_Horn of Xelthos|r, inside Shadowfang Keep)" },
      },
      { only = "Rogue", source = "polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-horn-of-xelthos",
        { "text", text = "Back to the dead drop" },
        { "text", text = "Place the horn in the |cOXP_PICK_Dead Drop|r near Pyrewood. The payment may not appear immediately: check a capital mailbox for C's follow-up letter on your next planned city visit, then return to this chest for the reward quest. Do not repeat the dungeon just because the payment is not yet offered." },
